| `check_F` tool specs | Refuses a malformed `kind: tool` spec, a refused default owner, a tool or agent document whose `TBD` owner (in any letter case) has no default owner to inherit, one whose owner is outside the CONVENTIONS §12 grammar, and one whose owner is a written null (`null` in any letter case, or `~`); warns on one with no owner at all. | `make check` | [`accountability.default_owner`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | A `TBD` owner counts as owned once the default is set, whoever the default names; a missing or empty owner is a WARN, not an error. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
